# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the lsan-gate lifecycle probe.
# Every entry here must correspond to a DOCUMENTED accepted-minor in
# PRODUCTION_ROADMAP.md / CHANGELOG — a suppression without a paper trail
# is a hidden leak. Keep this list short; shrinking it is Phase-2 work.

# _builtin_supervise's caller-side specs[] array: a one-time ~N*sizeof(spec)
# allocation per supervise() call; an async init-race makes freeing it
# unsafe (documented accepted-minor, Phase 1).
leak:_builtin_supervise
